{
    "pageid": 6238,
    "title": "Contact us",
    "sections": [
        {
            "heading": "Introduction",
            "level": 1,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "The Paradox Wikis network are dedicated to various games published by Paradox Interactive . Their main purpose is to allow the community build a repository of game-related knowledge (aka Community Wikis ), useful for both new and experienced players and for modders."
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "The wikis are administered by grotaclas , Kami-sama and SolSys with the help of a community volunteer team."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "Paradox Wikis discord",
            "level": 2,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Wiki users and editors alike can join the Paradox Wikis on Discord for the following reasons:"
                },
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "Contact the Wiki team directly for support issues.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Collaborate with other editors on various wiki projects.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Make improvement suggestions and work with others to implement them.",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "Wiki forum threads",
            "level": 2,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "All PDX wikis have dedicated forum threads on their game's sub-forum. Users can post in these threads to ask questions or collaborate with others."
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "These threads are monitored by the wiki moderation team so there's a high chance of them responding quickly (up to a day or two)."
